<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><title>The Bell Archive</title><%- include("partials/metadata") %><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/archive-v2.css"></head><body><%- include("partials/header") %>
<main class="archive-page listing-page"><section class="archive-hero compact"><p class="archive-kicker">THE ARCHIVE · I</p><h1>THE BELL</h1><p class="archive-intro">The recurring voice of the Order. Bell Reports are formal research outputs; they are not raw public submissions. Experiences enter through the Experience Archive and may later contribute to investigation and publication.</p><a class="archive-action" href="/report">SUBMIT AN EXPERIENCE</a></section>
<section class="library-grid"><% if (reports.length) { reports.forEach(item => { %><article class="library-record"><p class="code"><%= item.report_code %> · v<%= item.version %> · <%= item.bell_status %></p><h2><%= item.title %></h2><% if(item.subtitle){%><p class="author"><%= item.subtitle %></p><%}%><p class="excerpt"><%= item.abstract_text || item.research_question || 'Formal report record.' %></p><p class="meta"><%= item.publication_date %><%= item.discipline_codes ? ` · ${item.discipline_codes}` : '' %></p></article><% }) } else { %><p class="empty-record">No Bell Reports have yet been formally published from HRS.</p><% } %></section>
<p class="archive-footnote">Case File = working record · Bell Report = structured publication · The Bell = recurring journal of the Order.</p></main></body></html>
